<title>CHILE: Cristalerias Chile SA Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Cristalerias Chile SA Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glass-maker Cristalerias Chile SA reported the following results in the first three months of the year.</p>
<p>		  Q1 1997	   Q1 1996</p>
<p>Net profit    2.31	   profit  1.90</p>
<p>Oper profit   3.16	   profit  2.28</p>
<p>Non-oper loss 0.23	     loss  0.26</p>
<p>Sales revs    21.10		   14.23</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of Chilean pesos. ((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595 x 212))</p>
</text>
